        "description": {
          "$parts": ["You have now gained possession of the ",{"$talk":10910},", your own space vessel. With it, you can travel throughout the galaxy to any world you choose. Unfortunately, your choices are fairly limited ",{"$talk":48485}," now, because the ",{"$talk":5596}," Council will not let you leave ",{"$talk":986},".\n  Most of your party will remain aboard the ",{"$talk":10910}," while you explore ",{"$talk":986},". Should you need them, they will await you there.\n  In one of the holds, there is a workshop of tools you could use to upgrade existing weapons and armor if you buy enhancements for them.\n  Additionally, it would seem that Davik had stored a swoop bike aboard the ",{"$talk":10910}," before you stole it. If you found a track somewhere, you might be able to make some good money with it."]
        },
